            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129603?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Changes for WebDriver conformance for the Firefox 151 release based on the <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/buglist.cgi?columnlist=component%2Cresolution%2Cassigned_to%2Cshort_desc%2Cbug_type%2Cstatus_whiteboard&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;product=Remote%20Protocol&amp;resolution=FIXED&amp;f1=cf_status_firefox151&amp;o1=equals&amp;v1=fixed&amp;f2=cf_status_firefox150&amp;o2=notequals&amp;v2=fixed&amp;f3=status_whiteboard&amp;o3=notsubstring&amp;v3=%5Bwptsync%20downstream%5D&amp;component=Agent&amp;component=Marionette&amp;component=WebDriver%20BiDi&amp;list_id=17970146\" rel=\"nofollow\">release note worthy bugs in this list</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/juliandescottes/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/juliandescottes\">@juliandescottes</a> and <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/lutien/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/lutien\">@lutien</a> can you please review?</p>",
