                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds a hint and link to the Extension Workshop article on debugging background scripts after the first background script code snippet to help readers who may not know how to view the console output in the example.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #33315.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2269551229\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/33315\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/33315/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/33315\">#33315</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43963",
            "title": "Issue-33315 debug hint in native msg guide",
