        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/755354?u=7e7c1abdb78aea9b0b6b14e40544503f72b34789&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds <code class=\"notranslate\">css-at-rule-descriptor</code> (e.g. <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/At-rules/@counter-style/additive-symbols\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/At-rules/@counter-style/additive-symbols</a>) and <code class=\"notranslate\">css-media-feature</code> (e.g. <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/At-rules/@media/any-hover\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/At-rules/@media/any-hover</a>) pages to the sidebar, as they don't currently appear.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Should probably wait for <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4350683804\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/rari/issues/654\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/rari/pull/654/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/rari/pull/654\">mdn/rari#654</a> to land before this, so the nested pages render under a <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;details&gt;</code> element.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #642.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4299424753\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/rari/issues/642\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/rari/issues/642/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/rari/issues/642\">mdn/rari#642</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43961",
