        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds the following pages:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">input.performActions</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">input.releaseActions</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">input.setFiles</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">input.fileDialogOpened</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Quick note about short-titles in front matter</strong>: In this module, I've used shorter short-titles (eg, performActions instead of input.performActions) - this only affects command (and event) names in the sidebar and breadcrumb. I'll update the short-titles in the already published <code class=\"notranslate\">session</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">browser</code>, and <code class=\"notranslate\">log</code> modules in a follow-up PR.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Spec links</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#command-input-performActions\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#command-input-performActions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#command-input-releaseActions\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#command-input-releaseActions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#command-input-setFiles\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#command-input-setFiles</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issue</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Doc issue: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1530711349\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/339\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/mdn/issues/339/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/339\">mdn/mdn#339</a></p>",
